<title>UK: Prowting buys Magnus for 11.6 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Prowting buys Magnus for 11.6 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Housebuilder Prowting Plc said on Friday that it is buying Magnus Holdings Ltd for 11.6 million stg in cash.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the payment is subject to adjustment following finalisation of completion accounts.</p>
<p>&quot;It (Magnus) materially increases our landbank, giving us greater depth in the south-west of England and extending our activities in the Midlands,&quot; said Terry Roydon, chief executive of Prowting.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
